      "published": "Tue, 08 Sep 2026 14:46:00 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>LGBTQ+ inclusive data journalism is more important now than ever, here’s how to start By Emilia Ruzicka &#124; Published September 8, 2026 Inclusive reporting is more important than ever as basic democratic freedoms are under attack in the U.S. More and more, LGBTQ+ people are being excluded from spaces like public bathrooms and youth sports,&#8230;</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.ire.org/2026/09/08/lgbtq-inclusive-data-journalism-is-more-important-now-than-ever-heres-how-to-start/\">LGBTQ+ inclusive data journalism is more important now than ever, here’s how to start</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.ire.org\">Investigative Reporters and Editors</a>.</p>",
