      "published": "Wed, 09 Sep 2026 08:56:55 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>Asian newsrooms are moving faster on artificial intelligence, digital audiences and new forms of collaboration, but familiar pressures around staffing and revenue remain. That is the broad picture emerging from the latest 2025 State of Asian Newsrooms report.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/09/innovation-ai-and-uncertainty-key-findings-from-the-2025-state-of-asian-newsrooms-report/\">Innovation, AI and uncertainty: Key findings from the 2025 State of Asian Newsrooms report</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
      "source": "WAN-IFRA"
    },
